1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,966
Hi! We're Ibrahim and Melvyn, Team NeuralAI.

2
00:00:03,116 --> 00:00:05,036
Our challenge: astronaut health.

3
00:00:05,036 --> 00:00:07,916
Our inspiration: Mars, where no doctor is close.

4
00:00:08,066 --> 00:00:11,501
Meet AURA. Your crew's health, even when Earth is twenty minutes away.

5
00:00:11,651 --> 00:00:17,027
AURA learns each astronaut's own baseline, warns days early, and says what to do.

6
00:00:17,027 --> 00:00:18,089
Ask it by voice.

7
00:00:18,089 --> 00:00:21,208
It's built on real NASA Inspiration4 crew data.

8
00:00:21,358 --> 00:00:28,590
Next, AURA could protect crews on the Moon and Mars, and people in remote places on Earth, from Antarctica to rural clinics.

